  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acetylene is common the name of ethyne molecule. Polymerisation of alkynes&nbsp;produce addition polymers.&nbsp;Polymerisation of ethyne&nbsp;will produce poly-ethyne&nbsp;polymer. Polymers are large molecules formed by repeating units, which are known as monomers.<img src=\"assets\\st0072_3262bbebcac8.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 95px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
